  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/smn/hasJuvenileFreshwaterResidenceDuration",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Relates a named life-history type to its value on the juvenile freshwater residence duration axis: how long juveniles remain in fresh water between emergence and seaward migration."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A vocabulary-structure property: its subject is a concept in smn:LifeHistoryTypeScheme, and it records the decomposition that defines that named type rather than an observation about any fish. Domain is omitted rather than asserted as skos:Concept, which would be true of every concept in module 07 and therefore say nothing. The name carries \"duration\" because without it the property reads as whether the group has a freshwater residence at all, which is true of every anadromous salmon and therefore says nothing; it carries \"juvenile\" because adults also reside in fresh water, on a migration this axis does not measure."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/smn"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "has juvenile freshwater residence duration"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/smn/JuvenileFreshwaterResidenceDurationScheme"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/smn/hasJuvenileRearingHabitat",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Relates a named life-history type to its value on the juvenile rearing habitat axis: the kind of fresh water in which juveniles rear before migrating to sea."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A vocabulary-structure property, like smn:hasJuvenileFreshwaterResidenceDuration. The value is a kind of water, never a named water body: smn:hasJuvenileRearingHabitat asserts lake-versus-flowing-water, and the unqualified name a future property relating a population to an actual lake or river would want is deliberately left free. \"Rearing\" rather than \"nursery\" because rearing habitat is the settled term for the juvenile freshwater growth phase in the Pacific salmon literature, while nursery area carries a distinct, largely marine and estuarine sense. A named type may carry no value on this axis: smn:SockeyeSeaTypeLifeHistory does not."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/smn"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "has juvenile rearing habitat"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/smn/JuvenileRearingHabitatScheme"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/smn/hasLifeHistory",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Relates a Conservation Unit, population, or stock to a named life-history type from smn:LifeHistoryTypeScheme."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "One of the three life-history properties (Brett Johnson, 2026-08-24): this one assigns a named type, and smn:hasJuvenileFreshwaterResidenceDuration and smn:hasJuvenileRearingHabitat decompose what that type means. No generic axis-value property is minted. Assertion is at Conservation Unit, population, or stock level, not for an individual fish (Brett Johnson, 2026-08-17). The range is skos:Concept because the values are SKOS concepts; take them from smn:LifeHistoryTypeScheme, whose members are species-scoped."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/smn"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "has life history"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/smn/LifeHistoryTypeScheme"
      }
    ]
  },
